# Spotify Player Refined Vinyl View Walkthrough

I have refined the Spotify player to ensure it defaults to a **static** vinyl view when no music is playing.

## Changes Made

### Static Vinyl Default
- Introduced `effectivelyPaused` logic in [MDVinylPlayer](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/SpotifyPlayer.tsx#195-488) which considers the record "paused" if either `isPaused` is true OR no `currentTrack` exists.
- This ensures that the record is visible but **not spinning**, and the tonearm remains in the **parked position** until music actually starts.
- Once music is detected from Spotify, the record will automatically begin to spin and the tonearm will move to the playing position.

### Connection Suggestion
- Maintained the improved "Connect Spotify" suggestion UI for users who have not yet linked their accounts.

## Verification

### Visual Verification
